The '''Monday Blitz Stage''' or '''Guerrilla Monday Stage''' (ゲリラ月曜ステージ ''Gerira Getsuyō Sutēji'') is a harder variation of the basic [[Monday Stage]]s. Each time the player clears this stage, they will be rewarded with a [[Rich Cat]].

