==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 36.33 seconds<sup>1,090f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 38.33 seconds<sup>1,150f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 66 seconds<sup>1,980f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
**2 [[The Face|Faces]] spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using long-ranged cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lizard Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] will be helpful along with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to deal a lot of damage to the stage boss.

[[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]] and [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]] are the best way to beat this stage if you are an early game player

If you are a late game player, and want to speedrun this level, use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], and any rusher or attacker like Awakened Bahamut Cat or Mecha Bun to kill the bun bun and beat the stage in less than a minute.

